libutils Looper on poll and a pipe for QNX (q20-android)

QNX has neither epoll nor eventfd. The wake signal is a nonblocking pipe, and
pollInner polls the wake pipe plus every registered request; addFd and
removeFd edit the request map and wake the poller. The epoll rebuild logic is
compiled out.

